iv>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"rarity\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Rarity</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"3 Stars\"><img alt=\"3 Stars\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wutheringwaves/images/1/11/Icon_3_Stars.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/74?cb=20240514214126\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"74\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Icon 3 Stars.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_3_Stars.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tEffect\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"effect\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Provides 3,000 Weapon EXP.</div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tHow to Obtain\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"source1\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Source&#160;1</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Simulation Training</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"source2\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Source 2</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Huanglong Exploration</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"source3\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Source 3</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Quests</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"source4\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Source 4</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Synthesis</div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<div class=\"description-wrapper\"><div class=\"description-content\">A supplement storing a small amount of Tacetite Energy. It can be used to recharge the core modules of Tacetite Weapons. Routine preventative maintenance of weapons is advised for all Resonators, or they may find themselves caught off guard in the case of an emergency.</div></div>\n<p><b>Medium Energy Core</b> is an Upgrade Material for <a href=\"/wiki/Weapons\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Weapons\">Weapons</a> that provides 3,000 Weapon EXP. <br /> Each use requires <span class=\"item\"><span class=\"item-image\"><span class=\"hidden\" style=\"height:30px;width:30px\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shell_Credit\" title=\"Shell Credit\"><img alt=\"Shell Credit\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Item Shell Credit.png\" data-image-key=\"Item_Shell_Credit.png\" d